Policy Name: PII_MASKING_POLICY
Type: Privacy Policy
Regulation: HIPAA-adjacent

Rule:
"All user identifiers must be
SHA-256 hashed before Silver layer"

Applied to:
→ user_id column in Silver
→ user_id column in Gold
→ user_id in Feature Store

Enforcement:
→ Glue Job 1 applies masking
→ Automated - no manual step
→ Audit logged in CloudWatch

Owner: Compliance Team
Status: Active ✅
