Policy Name: DATA_RETENTION_POLICY
Type: Retention Policy

Rules:
→ Bronze (raw): 90 days retention
→ Silver (processed): 1 year
→ Gold (aggregated): 7 years
→ ML models: 2 years

Enforcement:
→ S3 lifecycle rules
→ Automated deletion
→ CloudWatch alerts before deletion

Owner: Data Engineering Team
Status: Active ✅

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Policy Name: DATA_ACCESS_POLICY
Type: Access Control Policy

Rules:
→ Bronze layer:
   Only Data Engineering team
   
→ Silver layer:
   Data Engineering + Data Science
   
→ Gold layer:
   All teams (read only)
   
→ Tableau dashboard:
   Business users (aggregated only)

Enforcement:
→ IAM roles in AWS
→ S3 bucket policies
→ Redshift user permissions

Owner: Data Governance Team
Status: Active ✅

