Policy Name: DATA_QUALITY_POLICY
Type: Quality Policy

Rules:
→ Bronze: >99% valid records
→ Silver: 0 null user_ids
→ Gold: complete daily records
→ All layers: no duplicates

Enforcement:
→ Great Expectations checks
→ Glue job schema validation
→ CloudWatch quality alerts

Owner: Data Engineering Team
Status: Active ✅
