Policy Name: HEALTH_DATA_POLICY
Type: Compliance Policy
Regulation: HIPAA-adjacent

Rules:
→ No raw biometric data
   in non-secure storage
→ All health data encrypted
   at rest (S3 encryption)
→ All access audit logged
→ No data shared externally
   without masking

